        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1366500196,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "The plant is known as an occasionally invasive introduced species in some areas. It has been cultivated in Florida in the United States, and today, it occurs as a weed in some parts of the state.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "es": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (es): Flacourtia indica § Cultivo",
        "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flacourtia_indica#Cultivo",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
